WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.840
Kako da proja ne bude suva,

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.520
da bude savršeno mekana i sočna, a vazdušasta?

3
00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:05.940
Tajna je u tačnim merama.

4
00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.500
Pomešajte 12 kašika kukuruznog brašna,

5
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:10.000
4 kašike belog brašna,

6
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.300
dodajte prašak za pecivo, 3 jajeta,

7
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:14.980
200 ml jogurta, 200 ml kisele vode,

8
00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.960
100 ml ulja i 250 g feta sira.

9
00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.040
Dobro izmešajte,

10
00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:21.060
ali slobodno ostavite ovako komadiće sira.

11
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.580
Prvih 10 minuta pecite na 200 stepeni,

12
00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:26.660
a onda smanjite na 180 i pecite još 20 minuta.

13
00:00:26.780 --> 00:00:29.400
Uživajte u najmekšoj i najsočnijoj proji.
